# What the graphify knowledge graph should not read.
# gitignore syntax. Merged on top of .gitignore, and can only exclude further -
# it cannot re-include something .gitignore already dropped.
#
# build/ and managed_components/ are already pruned by graphify itself, so they
# are not listed here.

# ---- Test audio -------------------------------------------------------------
# graphify classifies .wav as "video" and would send all 114 of them (46.9 MB)
# through Whisper transcription. They are FT8/WSPR reference captures, not
# speech: the transcript would be noise, and the run would cost real time for
# nothing.
*.wav

# ---- Malformed directory ----------------------------------------------------
# A path-join bug somewhere wrote test\wav_reference into a directory whose
# name is a mangled absolute path. The name is NOT ascii: the colon is U+F03A,
# a private-use stand-in Windows uses when a real colon cannot be stored, so
# git shows it as "C\357\200\272devqmx-panadapter...". A literal ascii pattern
# does not match it - the leading wildcard is what makes this work.
# 27 tracked files, all test audio and its .txt sidecars. Also present in
# qmx-panadapter-p4. Excluded here rather than deleted: removing tracked files
# is a separate decision.
*devqmx-panadaptertestwav_reference/

# ---- Test fixture corpora ---------------------------------------------------
# Reference captures and their per-slot .txt sidecars: 130 .txt files that are
# decoder output, not prose. They would dominate the LLM extraction pass
# without describing any part of the design. The test CODE stays in the graph.
test/20m_busy/
test/wav/
test/wav_reference/
test/wav_reference_full/

# ---- Certificates -----------------------------------------------------------
# graphify already skips these as sensitive; named here so the intent is
# recorded rather than relying on its heuristic.
*.pem
